# Arc_HeadAtMark: no corpus run calls it (ruling 5, 2). Its callers are Op4_CallNative's dc.l at
# $0298DA and $02996E in stage 2 a4 spawn scripts, run right after Op2_FxMarkPlayerTarget has stored
# the player's x/y in g_ArcTargetX/Y. The cases run at Arc_PlanToMark's first call: the same kind of
# call (an a4 object's Op4_CallNative with that object in a6 and a mark set by the a2 op $5378),
# with the mark moved to each side of the object.

at $00926C

case as_marked

case mark_left_above
w $FFFFDF96 = {a6 + $2E} - $40
w $FFFFDF9A = {a6 + $32} - $30

case mark_right_below
w $FFFFDF96 = {a6 + $2E} + $90
w $FFFFDF9A = {a6 + $32} + $10
